line	<str>Read the stone tablet and take the note to receive the word translations scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the word translations scroll and click "Attempt Translation". Input the following words and press enter for each: Island, Water, Time, Vessel, North.</str>
line	
line	<str>Chat will show a prompt about having translated enough once you enter all words. The hole on Molch Island will not appear if any words are missing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb-up the rope to exit the hole.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Lake Molch via Boaty and select Molch Island. (Fairy ring with code DJR and head west.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the hole on Molch Island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the vines for a dirty note.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cut the vines with your secateurs and squeeze through them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the stone table labelled "1" in the image below to receive the second stone tablet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the stone tablet, then input the following words on the word translations scroll: West, Poison, Body, Food, Earth.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb-up the rope to exit the hole.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Xeric's Shrine.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the hole at Xeric's Shrine.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the stone table labelled "1" in the image below to receive the third stone tablet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the stone tablet, then input the following words on the word translations scroll: Make, Yes, No, Move, Arrive, East, South.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make your way to the Ruins of Morra. Enter the hole there.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the stone table labelled "1" in the image below to receive the final stone tablet.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Read the stone tablet, then input the following words on the word translations scroll: Few, Big, Sun, Moon, Life, Death, Mind, Home, Air, Fire.</col>
